\i0 \fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 Detaches a new thread for the message \b [\b0 \i aTarget\b \i0  \b0 \i aSelector\b \i0 :\b0 \i anArgument\b \i0 ]\b0 . The method \i aSelector\i0  must take only one argument and must not have a return value. The objects \i aTarget\i0  and \i anArgument\i0  are retained during the execution of the detached thread, then released. The detached thread is exited (using the \b exit\b0  class method) as soon as \i aTarget\i0  has completed executing the \i aSelector\i0  method.\
\fs14\
